sequenceDiagram
    participant Client
    participant API
    participant MinIO as MinIO Storage
    participant DB as Database
    participant Queue as RabbitMQ Queue
    participant Worker
    participant ClickHouse

    Client->>API: POST /datasets/:id/file (CSV)
    API->>API: Validate dataset & file
    API->>MinIO: Upload file to datasets/{id}/raw/{filename}
    API->>DB: Update dataset (file_name, uploaded_at)
    API->>DB: Invalidate & re-cache dataset
    API->>Queue: Publish DatasetFileSplit job
    API-->>Client: 204 No Content

    rect rgb(200, 220, 255)
    Note over Queue,ClickHouse: Asynchronous File Processing
    
    Worker->>Queue: Consume DatasetFileSplit job
    Worker->>MinIO: Download file from datasets/{id}/raw/{filename}
    Worker->>Worker: Split file into parts (max 10K lines)
    
    loop For each part
        Worker->>MinIO: Upload part to datasets/{id}/parts/{partNum}
        Worker->>Queue: Publish DatasetPartProcess job
    end
    
    Worker->>DB: Update dataset (records_count)
    
    Worker->>Queue: Consume DatasetPartProcess job
    Worker->>MinIO: Download part from datasets/{id}/parts/{partNum}
    Worker->>Worker: Parse CSV (date, time, OHLCV)
    Worker->>ClickHouse: Bulk insert candles
    Worker->>DB: Update dataset (start_time, end_time)
    end
